{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Step, step—something moved by the stream!",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Look close; a letter is joining the scene.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A ... A ... Alligator! Glide and hide | by the riverside",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Step to B: Boat. A boat floats on water and carries people or things.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C — Canoe. Canoe in view | paddle through blue",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Duck — that's D. A duck paddles on top of the water and dips its beak below.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "What did E find? Eel! Slide with the tide | long body side to side",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F ... F ... Frog! It hops on land and swims with strong back legs.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Step to G: Goose. Glide wide | grassy banks on either side",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H — Heron. It stands very still, then steps through shallow water.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Step by step beside the stream!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "A to Z—name what we've seen!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Iris — that's I. Wet-ground sight | iris flower opens bright",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "What did J find? June Bug! It is a shiny beetle that can fly on warm evenings.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "K ... K ... Kingfisher! Flash and splash | dive for fish, then back in a dash",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Step to L: Lake. A lake is a large area of water surrounded by land.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M — Minnow. Go with the flow | tiny fish darts to and fro",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Newt — that's N. A newt is a small amphibian with four legs and a long tail.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "What did O find? Oar! Row some more | long blade pulls toward the shore",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P ... P ... Pike! It is a long freshwater fish that waits among water plants.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Step to Q: Quail. Quail on the trail | ground bird with a little tail",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R — River. It flows downhill in a channel toward other water.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Swan — that's S. Glide beside | long curved neck, wings spread wide",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "What did T find? Trout! It swims in cool freshwater and flicks its tail against the current.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "Step by step beside the stream!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "A to Z—name what we've seen!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "U ... U ... Underwater Plant! Sway all day | underwater leaves bend this way",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Step to V: Valley. A valley is low land between hills or mountains, often with water running through.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W — Water Lily. Bright in the light | round leaves float, flower in sight",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X-ray Tetra — that's X. An X-ray tetra is a small translucent fish with a partly see-through body.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "What did Y find? Yellow Water Lily! Yellow in the light | broad leaves float, flower bright",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z ... Z ... Zooplankton! Tiny drifting zooplankton ride along with moving water.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "A ... Alligator! Make two quiet swimming hands.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "One step, B ... Boat! Row two slow strokes.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C? ... Canoe! Paddle left, then right.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D ... Duck! Paddle both hands gently.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "E ... Eel! Wiggle one hand in a long curve.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "One step, F ... Frog! Make one little finger-hop.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G? ... Goose! Glide one hand across the water.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Find H ... Heron! Hold two fingers tall, then take one slow step.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "I ... Iris! Open your hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "One step, J ... June Bug! Buzz your fingers in a small circle.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "K? ... Kingfisher! Make one quick hand-dive, then hold still.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Find L ... Lake! Spread both hands wide and calm.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-3",
      "text": "Step by step beside the stream!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-3",
      "text": "A to Z—name what we've seen!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "M ... Minnow! Dart one finger gently side to side.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "One step, N ... Newt! Walk two fingers, then wiggle a little tail.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "O? ... Oar! Row one slow stroke.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Find P ... Pike! Hold still, then make one quick fish-swim.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Quail! Make tiny pecking finger taps.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "One step, R ... River! Move one hand in a winding path.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "S? ... Swan! Curve one arm like a long neck.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Find T ... Trout! Flick one hand gently like a tail.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "U ... Underwater Plant! Sway both hands like underwater leaves.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "One step, V ... Valley! Dip both hands down between two hills.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "W? ... Water Lily! Hold one flat palm, then open a flower.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Find X ... X-ray Tetra! Make a gentle fish-swim with one hand.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-6-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-6",
      "text": "Step by step beside the stream!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-6-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-6",
      "text": "A to Z—name what we've seen!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Y ... Yellow Water Lily! Hold one flat palm, then open a yellow flower.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "One step, Z ... Zooplankton! Let fingertips drift slowly with the current.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Step by step beside the stream!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "A to Z—name what we've seen!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "Steps slow down beside the stream.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "A to Z—we named the scene!",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
